{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "fecd2e1cc80eabd4a9cd18ff5e5b0992b7ffdfd68b2e92cc430ef235f8bc696d", "ja": "証 ～Live～", "zh": "证据 ～Live～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "edcda22202ba5f1d65b3dbc44974e3b2bd23bdb1dc90c7791e6aa5c1bb2cb203", "ja": "公演当日。出番を待つ千早と静香は、口数も\n少なく集中していた。やり残した事はないか\nと尋ねるプロデューサーに、千早は、ふたり\nの本気のステージだけだと答える。みんなが\n見守る中、ふたりのステージが幕を開けた。", "zh": "演出当天。等待登台的千早和静香话不多，专心致志。制作人问她们还有没有什么没做完的事，千早回答说，只剩下两人全力以赴的舞台了。在大家的注视下，两人的舞台拉开了帷幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_06_1003_p", "source_sha256": "e3e59dd1987054a2a85183852cef0854808072d12e29e209ec93467f67460388", "ja": "（ふたりとも、今日は口数が少ない。\n緊張感が凄くて、肌がピリピリするほどだ……）", "zh": "（她们两个今天话都很少。紧张感强烈得让人浑身发紧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_06_1004_p", "source_sha256": "234985088cd4d3be0d233879f1e6b4fa7fc158ac9803eb10c76d4991230f4f1b", "ja": "コホン。さて……いよいよ新曲のお披露目だ。\nふたりとも、準備は万端だと思うけど……。", "zh": "咳咳。那么……终于要公开新歌了。\n我想两位都已经准备充分了，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_06_1005_p", "source_sha256": "9f65734d3ee279553ceb108cb632a5e704d6610c5b627512f1ca38613dae5fc8", "ja": "一応、聞いておくよ。\n……やり残したことは？", "zh": "我还是确认一下。\n……还有什么没做完的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_06_1006_002chi", "source_sha256": "2bcacaaec0d5d64d2462bbedec41bfc85ff2f29b83e3dabcf84b39429364ed20", "ja": "やり残したこと……。", "zh": "未尽之事……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_06_1007_015siz", "source_sha256": "86cbdb432ea3e2cc0965a1b86c2863126bd635c7230951a90c5cc81c03e90f03", "ja": "……、いいえ。", "zh": "……不，不是。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_06_1008_002chi", "source_sha256": "cc1053d802279e4114afa2604e5cd5cca853892e1468e5a7192d5ebc1c6855c2", "ja": "ありません。", "zh": "没有。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_06_1009_015siz", "source_sha256": "cc1053d802279e4114afa2604e5cd5cca853892e1468e5a7192d5ebc1c6855c2", "ja": "ありません。", "zh": "没有。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_06_1010_002chi", "source_sha256": "d226a7e0c50f6ef4491c21ce0c5644a9c2b2825a665ccf3528fc8abc26e97216", "ja": "でも、そうですね。\nあえて言うとしたら……。", "zh": "不过，确实是这样。\n如果非要说的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_06_1011_002chi", "source_sha256": "db0475961aca07ecfd8c7eeeb32b83501442f25034bf1385d183637dc4e53493", "ja": "静香との……本当の、本気のステージ。\nまだできていないのは、それだけです。", "zh": "与静香的……真正的、全力以赴的舞台。\n还没做到的，就只有这个了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_06_1012_015siz", "source_sha256": "084fd96b3eed28997af44a36204d6b240323812ec373bc171f6f4d3707cc8906", "ja": "千早さん……。", "zh": "千早……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_06_1013_p", "source_sha256": "9f221aee5109fe4e6da52ef0b393e7eaa0200f69da20c64fd606f357c1a6deed", "ja": "本当の、本気のステージか……たしかにそれは、\nレッスンではできないかもしれないな。", "zh": "真正的、全力以赴的舞台吗……确实，那或许不是练习能做到的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_06_1014_p", "source_sha256": "1e469f6a23641d5e09cb5772d020a183a372360001a013434486861ace243112", "ja": "だけど、いよいよその時だ。今日は全部を出そう。\n歌もダンスも、心も……自分も。全部、解き放って！", "zh": "可是，终于到了那个时刻。今天就把一切都展现出来吧。\n歌声、舞蹈、内心……还有自己。全部释放出来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_06_1015_002chi", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_06_1016_015siz", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_06_1017_se", "source_sha256": "6ef02678bbb0a60364af0be776fc93acbdffbd1196f09250bea87d0ea40c005c", "ja": "ワアアアアァーッ！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_06_1018_022ser", "source_sha256": "9cb35064373db5d26fd629f77c555fb69a3e22b8f5c68154f1d6b818bbacb6e3", "ja": "どうも、ありがとうございましたー！", "zh": "非常感谢大家——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_06_1019_se", "source_sha256": "0624e7db7b34ec612c8158bdffa4ae66ac0fc763a1fd2bc5f78e861fb14b3b8a", "ja": "ワアアアアアアァァァーッ！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_06_1020_009rit", "source_sha256": "cce01f7b91fa2d24fb68daa9ffb4975ee280d095a2cb172b9824aeba4bbc66ff", "ja": "うーん……春香、遅いわねぇ。\nもう終わっちゃうじゃない！", "zh": "嗯……春香，真慢啊。\n都快结束了不是嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_06_1021_006mak", "source_sha256": "1c5b80345f02f0cb2f7f05a3e1a32bc2e034ffbd3a49dcaf043d56ae1816fce3", "ja": "あれ？　あのリボン……やっぱりそうだ！　\nおーい、こっちこっち！", "zh": "咦？那个蝴蝶结……果然是她！\n喂——这边这边！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_06_1022_050jul", "source_sha256": "cfcf412239e1666ac5dac7507ec80c744e6c8a078426b79fed5181d2ff7a46d4", "ja": "OK、カンペキだ！\nお疲れ星梨花！", "zh": "OK，很完美！\n辛苦了，星梨花！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_06_1023_022ser", "source_sha256": "a730cfc6be5a3564b644d6178fef9f51cfa535914015099476bff2741f75333f", "ja": "はあ、はあ……ジュリアさん、志保さん！\nわたし、ちゃんとできてましたか？", "zh": "呼，呼……茱莉亚先生、志保小姐！\n我刚才表现得还好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_06_1024_033sih", "source_sha256": "4181c07dde3119d5454eaad2705824d74c28458c96d3a3dca29ed9be20699245", "ja": "ええ、とっても。\nレッスンの成果、ちゃんと出ていたと思う。", "zh": "嗯，非常好。\n我觉得你把练习的成果充分展现出来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_06_1025_022ser", "source_sha256": "08b3ff44bb1eeb109ac264626f16225214a0e965d8d93df55e76905c9f720aa0", "ja": "えへへ、よかったです♪　……あ、未来さん、翼さん！\n早く、始まっちゃいますよっ！", "zh": "嘿嘿，太好了♪……啊，未来、翼！\n快点，要开始了哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_06_1029_se", "source_sha256": "a8bd2f04614e63c9d634b14111a6d47e87b51fc752160d2b2ee25960d55118a5", "ja": "ワアアアアアアアアァァァーッ！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
